	(descr "Printed fold-back inverted-F antenna (MIFA), 2.4 GHz, BSN-N52 openEMS sims, board r6, sim run d2774450d4: fmifa S=1.825 H=4.6 A=12.4 D=1.5 R=5.5 W=1  (15.7 x 4.6 mm, L 25.3 mm). Origin = feed point on the ground edge, keep-out 20 x 5 mm on every copper layer (fixed, the antenna is tuned inside it), no notch. Antenna and pads under solder mask. Pad 1 feed (0.5 mm, routed trace to L1), short-to-feed gap 0.575 mm, pad 2 ground (short leg). Matched with the L2-C1-L1 T: 4.7 nH / 0.5 pF / 8.2 nH (sim r7 final, 4-port S-matrix with solder mask, match centred 2.44 GHz).")
